{"availability":"available","full":"ben-milanko/dart-pdf","name":"dart-pdf","description":"DartPDF is a free, local PDF editor for Android, iPhone, iPad, Mac, Windows, Linux and web. Annotate, fill forms, sign and redact without an account. The repository also contains a pure-Dart PDF engine and Flutter viewer/editor SDK.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Dart","stars":88,"forks":17,"created":"2026-06-09T22:28:42Z","updated":"2026-10-15T21:39:29Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://dart-pdf.com","topics":["acroform","annotations","cross-platform","dart","desktop-app","digital-signatures","document-processing","flutter","flutter-package","ocr","pdf","pdf-annotations","pdf-editor","pdf-library","pdf-parser","pdf-renderer","pdf-viewer","redaction","text-extraction"],"demo":"https://dart-pdf-demo.web.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T21:46:42.435Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T21:46:42.435Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T21:46:42.435Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:17:00.397Z","stars":82,"forks":17},{"at":"2026-10-06T15:45:35.289Z","stars":83,"forks":17},{"at":"2026-10-08T16:06:22.228Z","stars":83,"forks":18},{"at":"2026-10-09T18:00:35.895Z","stars":86,"forks":18},{"at":"2026-10-13T04:14:36.447Z","stars":86,"forks":17},{"at":"2026-10-15T21:46:42.435Z","stars":88,"forks":17}],"technologies":["Flutter"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Want the app, not the SDK? DartPDF is the official PDF editor built on this library. Edit, annotate, sign, and fill PDFs entirely on your device, with no account and no uploads. Get it at dart-pdf.com or open it in your browser. Need to complete a form? Fill and sign a PDF with DartPDF explains existing fields, flat forms, drawn signatures, and saving a checked copy.","An open-source Flutter PDF editor, viewer, and renderer written entirely in Dart. No PDFium, no platform channels.","The goal is a PSPDFKit-class SDK built natively for Flutter: a fast vi